@startuml
title H02 - Hub persistence
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
interface "HubJournal::commit(); pending_cloud(); acknowledge_cloud(); contains()" as API
database "Owned state\nbounded ordered records, event-ID set and application-ACK set" as State
queue "Input / output\nDomainEvent → Stored/Duplicate/Full; committed records → cloud outbox batch" as IO
API --> H02
IO --> H02
H02 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
H02 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "H04\nHub coverage" as H04
H02 ..> H04 : contract / port
component "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
H02 ..> H05 : contract / port
component "H08\nHub cloud link" as H08
H02 ..> H08 : contract / port
note bottom of H02
Flow: Check event key; commit once; expose unacknowledged records; retain until backend application-commit ACK.
Guard: Full returns Full and therefore no DURABLE node ACK. Duplicate returns committed equivalence. MQTT PUBACK is intentionally absent from retirement API.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
